{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 686,
  "batch_count": 1697,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "89bbda6948bf092a08e3287e29276a39db038159",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d3930e208b7fbbbd41b0768",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我把在这场竞赛中发现到的事情写下来了！\\n是想要在决赛前克服的问题点……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "06874c8b63bbaf2340cad750ef0fd0dab1604941edc6681ee16d043efef5cc5d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "586"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a486fa8b3420a803738d6fd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有、有的……但因为「进入闸门后就是\\n武藏与小次郎」！不论是谁我都会全力以赴！",
      "source_fingerprint": "22e80acb27d6cf6447220c2b840d4ee87858adf564e5b616cd5ea68b4d059d4b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "587"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2699b4cb5dd2d343bdd5e144",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "乳清蛋白。青花菜。菲力牛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "175ada32ccb2738aeb57c978378f33481d9d90358559a657f843cf6b599466da",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "588"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93846ad273683e42e105c6f1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯，小狗。比赛时也会紧跟过来，\\n是个听话的好孩子喔？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f054edd1f24f59dd021638d61081b8c09e45540d80ef2ff2f4aa770181dbf62b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "589"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8eeae685ffb07c84a1619694",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "都、都是多亏训练员为了今天，\\n帮我设计了各式各样训练项目的缘故……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1bfe087d5da15c4519912135380afcd75e697f527039988ec7b961df4f3af50",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "59"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d1a2ea1e55121bd24030cab",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这种问题的答案只有一个吧。\\n闪耀的一等星……看着我就够了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b4c4d31a537b13874feb3ea72a740829c3f99659c0e25e0783020ccf6df8aac",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "590"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12cd0b87d05947aebe02881e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我下场比赛的目标也是要用尽全力\\n在大家心中留下印象。还请看着我的表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "93cbc2dd5f2977e598021195d9bfc3cf76b9caf5f1e3c1cd5312a417ec6cb460",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "591"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:beead3952672a67cf47ef4e2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我跑得相当舒服……\\n对我来说，没有比这更值得感到喜悦的事情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e6a8b01578dbb1ba1c6a6754071d7b430afe7eae8c14d87ed7efd34847d30b5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "592"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ebab60904e2e93d94156a83",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我一定会赌上自己的一切，\\n持续跑到决赛为止。",
      "source_fingerprint": "00092ebd2f7851859e4c84981b4c5b8c192a686b783b198596edca43d69d3263",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "593"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7786a8c19c909bc2b2200883",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "无论有多想努力锻炼，若没有人给予指引\\n便会误入歧途。而你正是我的路标！",
      "source_fingerprint": "730d9c8eac5111e09f383b087985ec66c3f8d50be8304172233f665e710efe26",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "594"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d1e56dc6960a256002c39a5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我从现在起要去将八重垣流的强悍之处和精神\\n传达到竞赛的世界！请多指教！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fd14ec2cc1058881d21c6491167efe448022a4c71a2131c9b25a34dda50ef17",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "595"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d3a914d3696aedd6434c7d8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "卸下一切的伪装，拿出自己的一切互相较劲。\\n这恰恰等同于以真本事交锋的对决。",
      "source_fingerprint": "06ee65043002bd292ec05f109471bd733fd3385e7d33df38657693ff3733c618",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "596"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0828bb1c8a252232c969361f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯！所以推荐大家也都去喝喝看蜂蜜特饮喔！\\n虽然我就算没喝也跑得很快就是了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6f3438694280a7eff94da5b011d877c558f3e456b88c4703debd7397f9b35d9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:224856abfa12b5c9f6fa012d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会觉得我这么幸福真的可以吗……啊，不过\\n还有决赛要比！我、我会虾油的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f843e5a53c4dc98f927bb867e7ff1dde9d097b906894c115cb1021a2d7fd41a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "60"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7f2e90c6d05b8e56979aa67",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "就只能去累积能超越她们的修练成果了呢～\\n正所谓「没有能战胜努力的天赋」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "80c677cc22508f59eea059f0a41a4a6c2318a98b625c0bacaa061347e7e13594",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "600"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ef41a6c1a2cd55148dcbb5a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哎呀！若能与我敬爱的姐姐们在荣耀的舞台上\\n互相较劲，那真的是很幸运呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d484cad70c57db39c6f8be302cb3a43673168f22cd44c6e44ba51d2c7937152",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "601"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:000c18418793648d7d596934",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呵呵呵，训练员有特别叮嘱我\\n要对这一类的提问保密了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2c57e1b2666d35a74c650ebba697b201fe1a8ba873bdc4a0addc0c6e024f414",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "602"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b637c9793872809c5248dcd4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实他们有一起在线观看我的比赛喔！\\n而且大大地称赞了我一番呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b37f35bfb883db9eaa737ff5c85c14dd3fb0922fb2ec313736d68aedea8bb3af",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "606"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d2bda591bfb5d38ead2838e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "获胜的话会有「爆进式的庆功宴」\\n在等着我……所以今天暂时先保留♪　",
      "source_fingerprint": "a854777072887d0b33794ab488073d23c1a097099ca8ec474e620c9e4dfccbe8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "607"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:358b3191de27504ae7e548fe",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "谢谢大家一直以来支持着身为花蕾的我，\\n并见证了我绽放的瞬间！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c7c449685e5e43c601f029e633c6b0040803057498ebee28ac0e62a300b6b29",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "608"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2d202f5d9d2fefc503c1709",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我还只是个挑战者！\\n会更加努力迈向日本第一的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "018f7ae0dca168d4ae933bcd8f4acbe50168cd5d99cabb77a3f4022d159a8e8b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "609"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d0bcde89ba8936ecaf10125",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是因为我喝了赖恩告诉我的乳清蛋白！\\n多亏这样才会充满力量喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "22f920eb410e9ac471ee4d91cf7b3b2e429ab01d13fb296af7778e22da4455af",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "61"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05f437edf871430449fa1afd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员跟妈妈，然后还有──\\n呃……太多人了根本无法决定～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7427a8f7218ec241ec63b3229952106b5319a2bda1e5b22924cb253353a3f362",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "610"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1508cf75521e3ecf73f5ebe",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "为什么你会知道……是的，\\n等出席过队伍的庆功宴之后……",
      "source_fingerprint": "68b474d15b0badf85d1e769952eb759ec79417924d3b9b35fa9fd84f5d2c6e4b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "611"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6b9d3dbb153b21d61dc3630",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "没有特别做什……啊，闸位的颜色\\n好像是幸运色？是别人告诉我的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d534dcc7d5db69613153441762e66771035d89f85a87d5c8c11026e4b67cf92c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "612"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d9a00539dd37a6db5046eb5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那当然！而且还要「浓稠双倍增量」！\\n今天就尽情地加入自己喜欢的配料吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "70e9d2a484829d6d9e9477c60a9686495252a27a468fcfd9635ac1aa2959b3e9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "613"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0103de94480002f31ed19093",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "与队伍的大家开庆功宴！\\n也得叫训练员一起来热闹一下呢～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d358c172fad4d9bcd5604dcb319f6720ff2fe16387d50a8ac77a60a6b69abcc4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "614"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1390d0b315be3ec8402eeec1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "今后也会拿出酷炫又完美的表现给大家看，\\n恳请支持啰☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4fc95b08cb4fa2bb4802d9330e6e5e4201744526f69f44c12463c0fbf579894",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "615"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1f6a69d21ead5076de1785c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有啊，我想在舞台上多追加一个站台！\\n这样肯定会变得像迪斯科舞厅一样热闹喔～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7e3258fd09889bc7d74313e6e30e8be4b09e6753a2b8ac613bb4a3714b5a509",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "616"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e681f6249373d05f8527a6a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这里对我而言还是在舞台之上。\\n「后台」发生的事就等有空时再说……好吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8489d62f83a36e94dc60466a0e2b2db65cc42b5c0202ce4fc7572bb6043b7d8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "617"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ba957e4b09be7744947c2ee",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哎呀～别哭啊！来，用这条手帕……\\n（飞出鸽子）呵呵，眼泪这下停住了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e6ff5dc4ac468f73c0b488d27488667705807febc0cdce8dd244c95a5e55243",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "618"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:541fb4fae5325e8cae28d3f6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这个嘛，炒面、关东煮、土手煮、炸串、\\n板条……还有炸金川烧和（以下略）",
      "source_fingerprint": "abff7a22d25ca2d6d12b3a0fb12746d010255381d1964288a0455504221b6d21",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "619"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfb71b55d51c96a793488a0b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想着能让自己加快脚步往前冲的情境喔！例如\\n外送的拉面要糊掉啦～之类的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2677ec75b46183fc360d6d47c738bd044406b44ade19ddbc22bc3c29bdfb0e8b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "62"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19a1b0001ef2571ea5029f59",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有点难为情呢……但既然如此，\\n我接下来想以「终极赛马娘」为目标。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5a905962131dfda02c615d7aa710c947f3ef03cabc7ce458ce6712273d13aec",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "620"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82bd3d8e1fa4fd76be5674f7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "从一开始就没有什么敌人啦。大家都是\\n无可取代的同伴……是家人啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea31fe42938abd5e46a44671b9d40e5ac8e47530c932da111c7087f84dd8b0e1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "621"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d0f0a0881689ecaa7698e1b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哦！就知道你会有那种要求，\\n所以我已经派出企鹅传书送出去啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb8c2e8a6f4dc07ac44fd12bd6976f6b9f5c85a7874702bafb9d13d0094d53a3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "622"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2da4f5612bf46e76105dced",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我已经来到这里了……\\n但可不会一直等下去，所以你也快点来吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9056eb1675747a090d8142ee55b84824a3a3b9085d0ee46b8e350ea46fa440f1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "623"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:347a6a2c794c3a17662ceab0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "就只是顺着风随兴地跑下去……\\n然后和一定要打败她的那家伙一决高下而已！",
      "source_fingerprint": "31d9b93cb18f995b616f1b54aa282420493ad4d5284904eb820d4ad156840c82",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "624"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0df59e3c2bd7478bb518566e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我已经透过竞赛把自己的心情都说完了。\\n……接下来就只等对方的回复！",
      "source_fingerprint": "95577b9ca6c74af0f98061b3a436c23d9f319184439a62a9447e2df2d6d3e1ec",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "625"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bfe0747f2619719c6110b97",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "一旦爬上了山顶，就代表下山的时刻来临。\\n所以我会从起点再一次爬上去♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6792beaca1aa66ee9572f830e68b0822b35dd412ba04f35cd24297f3302edcb1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "626"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3f0344c43af13735806b849",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当然是要办一场Big party！\\n不管是谁都Welcome！大家一起狂欢吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9dabe2db29914b577d7d741985eb8b352dfb053b5d04a0f15e35e9b3ec8383fa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "627"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4acff9ef132b486c4eee1b1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "首先要给训练员一个热情的Hug！\\n这次可不会让他Runaway啰～～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "76973c23d294cc2841b30075cbf2515ec83798b0ebcf2e905053984abee8fab8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "628"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a11a93fcba9b601686737307",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "「断而敢行，鬼神避之」，\\n总之我没有让自己在气势上输给别人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a1431f1c90c2e496ebf2d5af26ff0babae51759d1d1363520fe29eed0403f43",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "629"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8903c98f0e0be4db14af6ef6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "透过仿真竞赛所获得的数据果然比不上\\n实际竞赛中能获得的数据！实在太棒了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8c6927af2f8523245df13ae7a970527f1955a102a3a8c407d1e0ba658e76851",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "63"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6a1be5527053285dacf05cd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "既然是在竞赛中赌上一切较量过的同伴……\\n我想彼此之间已无须言语了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7283a83eef13a7e2d2dc962593f99e9adf61523073f1240a50157a603089f0d3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "630"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3f62d9048488e1563b620d2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的单挑对决让你们热血沸腾了对吧？\\n嘿嘿，今后也别把视线给移开喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "de03cedfcecfb4a6915c2f6e3a8b60c063ff0e74cd8b4e92e07c18b98b499f44",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "631"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d63f41e54f5b6d3746abf58",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练公！多亏你我才能跑出精彩的对决！\\n等我做些好吃的答谢你啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e4285f5ae1f4c865d8a9c7a657c7fd12ff9a1c2bd51039729b1a85b5a6b1b51",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "632"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05614dc06e2d561846968b52",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那当然是我期待已久的甜点──！\\n啊…‥这也是为了要补充营养喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "abd91af534e25deff0d12541038599b39c5f4695be96909b3cf92a5180657b16",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "633"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd1fc5f4fcf436b3402aa09e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "总是给予我支持的目白家成员，\\n以及与我互相切磋琢磨的各位！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a06aaae1e7a688a69d2f7d5257096bfd7f65e4fddfef58fb102b41c2ba76cd78",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "634"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4516fd5755eeda7ca4834639",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最强！最棒！最精彩！这样\\n就距离无敌──世界第一又更近了！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5b426a6344066a5536c9a5b3e0b95d800dffe94e26fa6538dacd60d684b3c03",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "635"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b3c7da11d75a88445fc26e1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当然是家人……还有所有劲敌们！\\n我们的对决之后也要继续下去！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "32e4cc39748558c57f3ce6877111ed6864edf5fe37545105b1eddf7501a197d6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "636"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cc3a7f76c10f899b01f0f49",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我确实也看到了喔。岂止是微笑，那副姿态\\n根本是高声大笑！哈──哈、哈、哈！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f21fea7ff5d9dcecf7f0dda321b659abdf20e81ec6c44be336664eedc4026ce",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "637"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:067aef0aec1514bac1e29b05",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这还只是第一个夜晚……瓦尔哈拉尚在远方。\\n和我一起前往……那应许之地的尽头吧！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b22b549d420a5908da7099e85a5dee59fe4af85316226fa6288a4be881cc2699",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "638"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37f35e72b3caec74ef1de6be",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "都是些眼神凌厉的家伙……这样正好。\\n老实说，很久没有如此让人感兴趣的对决了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d122de7ed0e0a4e31194ed72877abe632e12d319ad45343a69dcbdc4b2756325",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "639"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:006811e7d31703a9d7dd2415",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这场竞赛中有着表现超出我预期的对手呢……\\n哎呀，所以竞赛才会这么有趣啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d629a54d6b624c05b3ea65c2d101a2974e21cf34a329add5f683f36bb526d20",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "64"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5310f23113d45da6fcfb6340",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "怎么可能……跑了场燃烧不完全的竞赛后，\\n渴望「下次」的身体已经在隐隐作痛了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "430f83caead7e9dca309410ccc520b509587f21629dea0a2d5e4983a196b220a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "640"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f2f1f6bf15bac8939728420",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有人为此高兴不已呢。呵呵，能看到那些\\n绽放出笑容的脸孔也让人相当愉快。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd1436e16dbb1712ec7f0f72ca84d9e0049c89833ee8a119226d2f0590043a36",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "641"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd9431efe038c7b94117308d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "万千思绪也不过只是转瞬梦境。\\n因此只需志在千里，无穷无尽地向前迈进！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a64a66ac593c80310c5704aafb19dd5554903aee5d249cf957a4439acdc61276",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "642"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f43897e3a2a5aa9b7177c587",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那就……妈妈……这就是我如今的表现。\\n今后也会继续以你为指标向前迈进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "235306a696f5ecde05b31f227312f293ae1d5b034958b2058678c02a5cd1f1c8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "643"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8068d6056265614a4ca866a6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这些紫色的玫瑰，是粉丝刚才送给我的……\\n呵呵，我会心怀感激地装饰在房间里。",
      "source_fingerprint": "066773ce0766fcba97cb3cf3a6ccb6bac479479c23b113c5217b26853fa9cf33",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "644"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7fc3a6c608a68f780893794",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "没有没有……！这一定是因为有\\n训练员这位大贤者的力量加持！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7be33cfa97a922e3bc448105a6a87273e8d9374a708e96a50cb0a4a5e3459b75",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "645"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84f3c9aba266dd4c7490a2bf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我想将今天的回忆深深烙印在心中，\\n并且将心中这股火爆的激情表达出来！！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b94a09a3d58faba99f8a4d2d81bed1302af0caa79dfaaf328ab0b8f9be8a3760",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "646"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c08daed04bc48338038a2dc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哈啰──训练员有在看吗──？\\n……就说小青该出手时就会出手对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8775a2e09d3d90c2319c82b5b8a9dd5b2cadd4577ba6f455cb434ad9f1ed8172",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "647"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55278ae40804232e82644818",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呵呵呵～你正摆出「怎么可能」的表情吧？\\n我就想看到那种表情呢──♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "86d992cf214173c5f301208010d504666f8c0fdd70f5ed0540c4852408e7d38b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "648"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e88e03a7f76ba4dff6b826b1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的家人们都有在看吗～～！！？\\n一起去痛快地大吃一顿美食吧～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "05c8dfc57d32c8e762c0021be3691bade0d0fc54211c0399dddcee9a7a9efb46",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "649"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:806be7e59ec8c9a7d57ce7a7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……谢谢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ac818ccb0e8089349de1a330b5b5174d029206740e791653051d1392dec2d1c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "65"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eeb247c855a2fcc09b71f69e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真的很谢谢大家为我加油……！\\n你们的心情，都有好好地传达给我啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9f7024e4965d57ae01b08c07d04328fad8931d29264295a5f89f262fd165b24",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "650"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62690e97a3d1ab65428675d6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我认为自己的表现，能为祖国和这个国家之间\\n开启一道崭新的历史大门……",
      "source_fingerprint": "38aced44747c92bba946dd717734cdb6dda8f24537a944c998e8fd4cf6ea12ec",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "651"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bdbad392257e35dd77c345f2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那些欢呼声，还有大家的表情……我绝对\\n不会忘记这片景色。我获得了宝贵的回忆。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5483e802275a7362117edf9d5f9a44782b0f1affbd61fe207c874fbf4086dc5e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "652"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2cf3a83d062c483a5765c1a2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我想自己应该或多或少有带给大家\\n一场有趣的竞赛了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "50d93096bb970da7b4810af1b81844b16bf6732c8040626c527b66549853215a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "653"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e2313da6f81fe7b96c439d0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "父亲、母亲……还有白仁。我们就全家一起去\\n吃顿饭，然后一边慢慢地聊吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5489d7ecc7c9b2506970c74caf4b2e9d8f9144445bab0bcd6b5a8a72e52fa4f8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "654"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ea9835f880bdfe8060c68b9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "就说人家会展现出最完美的飞行给你看！\\n跟我说的一样对吧，训练员♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "84ba3c41f727ef824f11595672aa2ccf0fa700ce8d021c49ae290858b606aaae",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "655"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d15901d269aaf000d91c5dd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "感谢大家的声援～☆谢礼是……啾♪\\n欸嘿嘿，这是感谢的着陆Kiss！",
      "source_fingerprint": "febacfc2ecf442e5d3fef24ee0d8709cb0fcb55f114191d6906fcb98dafc91fc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "656"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2403710b3aec0d0a08c96b0d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那道影子……看起来似乎更近了一点──\\n虽然它还是非常遥远……",
      "source_fingerprint": "29a4cadf7427697d8e1b634c3c78e5a2d6ed22e5633885664b9f7166db1d9089",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "657"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea9d4cb88f38c2746ef3b3e8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在安静的场所一边喝着咖啡……\\n一边回味今天发生的事情并牢牢地记住……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6dd1cbca2b88d02afd3b24105355d8115f52677f8bdb392e4c62a0b93bb086ad",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "658"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f68ba79be6416f9770415997",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "感谢。我判断之所以能完成这次的任务，\\n是因为有教练在的缘故。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f12c0287a87ece028a59f9b175df6eed371158a4465b69f3cbb48e3a995d5ef",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "659"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:337c6721ba9da0a59d9b5edf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "没有。我只是因为非赢不可，\\n所以才拿下了胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a09c2d03f8ef1c947ccd1fdb764401e73af083283a0c953f672074fc6f855cf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "66"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:871595fe7e312da3fdd30a58",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "搜寻中……发生错误。\\n思考回路超过负荷，无法输出词汇。",
      "source_fingerprint": "08400548b15d2f8149a4d0cb56a52eb960b49eae3f0b0fc400ed3b0cef1281f3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "660"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b476bfc09d2d6319c3bd4065",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我还不能代表目白家……\\n但很荣幸能以家族成员的身份上场表现！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4039e3492b0022d72ecf6d0dbef07addb36bda1ac374f2875bcb054d0918e73",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "661"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8df27488711fc2fc1a6ff05",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是你们呼唤「赖恩」的声音\\n推着我往前进的！谢谢大家！",
      "source_fingerprint": "318449cd9dafef1400fc355fe7cf4e115614f35dadf017700189bca349a72436",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "662"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
